#RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Krest-Neva/Shadowrocket/refs/heads/main/REJECT_RULES/SPLIT/REJECT_RULES_PLUS_1.list,REJECT-DICT
#RULE-SET,https://raw.githubusercontent.com/Krest-Neva/Shadowrocket/refs/heads/main/REJECT_RULES/SPLIT/REJECT_RULES_PLUS_2.list,REJECT-DICT
